sures explain the SFC decision without creating a stated firm-level threshold.","source_unit_ids":["d802c45a4262c.u0.0","d802c45a4262c.u1.381","d802c45a4262c.u3.801"],"status":"PROPOSED"},{"dimension":"modality","explanation":"The announcement proposes relief from margin requirements, not a prohibition on exchanging margin, a licensing trigger or a finding of compliance. The future Code amendment is separately announced.","source_unit_ids":["d802c45a4262c.u0.0","d802c45a4262c.u6.1357"],"status":"PROPOSED"},{"dimension":"time","explanation":"The announced SFC period starts inclusively on 4 January 2026 and continues until further notice. EU and UK dates are background. Subsequent notice status cannot be established from this packet.","source_unit_ids":["d802c45a4262c.u0.0","d802c45a4262c.u1.381","d802c45a4262c.u3.801","d802c45a4262c.u4.1019"],"status":"PROPOSED"},{"dimension":"dependencies","explanation":"The underlying Code, forthcoming amendment and any subsequent notice are needed to resolve legal implementation and detailed scope. Three dependencies are listed as missing without enough information to map each to a particular instrument.","source_unit_ids":["d802c45a4262c.u6.1357","d802c45a4262c.u15.1671","d802c45a4262c.u17.1837","d802c45a4262c.u19.1919","d802c45a4262c.u21.2176"],"status":"AMBIGUOUS"}],"questions":["What does Part III of Schedule 10, particularly paragraph 7(e), provide about the relevant corporations, transactions and margin obligations?","Has any subsequent SFC notice changed this exemption, and with what effective date and transitional treatment?","Does the amendment or gazettal establish any legal commencement condition absent from the circular?","Which instruments correspond to the three missing dependency identifiers?"],"readings":[{"assumptions":["The selected control tests applicability of the announced exemption to one corporation, one option transaction and one assessment date.","The explicit commencement date governs the announcement; the promised amendment and gazettal are not treated as unstated conditions precedent.","Product and actor classifications are supplied facts requiring appropriate assessment, not inferred from a product label or the Code's title.","Whether a later notice affects this transaction on the assessment date remains unknown unless supported by further evidence."],"citations":[{"quote":"inform licensed corporations that it will exempt non-centrally cleared single-stock options, equity basket options and equity index options","unit_id":"d802c45a4262c.u0.0"},{"quote":"from 4 January 2026 until further notice","unit_id":"d802c45a4262c.u0.0"},{"quote":"licensed corporations’ exposures to non-centrally cleared equity options are currently insignificant","unit_id":"d802c45a4262c.u1.381"},{"quote":"subject to monitoring and periodic reporting2.","unit_id":"d802c45a4262c.u3.801"},{"quote":"It implemented an indefinite exemption from the UK bilateral margining requirements for single-stock equity options and index options.","unit_id":"d802c45a4262c.u4.1019"},{"quote":"Paragraph 7(e) of Part III of Schedule 10 to the Code of Conduct will be amended accordingly and gazetted in due course.","unit_id":"d802c45a4262c.u6.1357"},{"quote":"As set out in Part III of Schedule 10 to the Code of Conduct for Persons Licensed by or Registered with the Securities and Futures Commission (Code of Conduct).","unit_id":"d802c45a4262c.u15.1671"}],"distinction":"This reading gives the expressly announced date independent effect while retaining the future-notice limitation. It does not import EU reporting conditions, UK permanence or an exposure threshold. A gazettal-dependent alternative would materially postpone eligibility, but the supplied text does not sufficiently support formalizing that alternative. The strongest uncertainty is the legal implementation and detailed scope supplied by the missing Code and later instruments.","family":"exceptions","formalization":{"facts":[{"meaning":"The assessed corporation is a licensed corporation addressed by the SFC circular.","name":"is_licensed_corporation","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["d802c45a4262c.u0.0"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean"},{"meaning":"The assessed margin obligation for this corporation and transaction would fall within Part III of Schedule 10 absent this announced exemption, taking other applicable scope conditions into account.","name":"otherwise_within_margin_requirements","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["d802c45a4262c.u15.1671"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean"},{"meaning":"The assessed option transaction is not centrally cleared.","name":"is_non_centrally_cleared","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["d802c45a4262c.u0.0"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean"},{"meaning":"The assessed instrument is a single-stock option, equity basket option or equity index option within the circular's listed categories.","name":"is_listed_equity_option","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["d802c45a4262c.u0.0"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean"},{"meaning":"The date for which applicability of the announced exemption is assessed.","name":"assessment_date","requires_judgment":false,"source_unit_ids":["d802c45a4262c.u0.0"],"type":"date","unit":"Gregorian calendar date"},{"meaning":"On the assessment date, no subsequent SFC notice has become effective that ends or displaces the announced exemption for this assessed transaction. Absence of such a notice from this packet does not establish this fact.","name":"announcement_remains_applicable","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["d802c45a4262c.u0.0"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean"}],"result":"(and is_non_centrally_cleared is_listed_equity_option (>= assessment_date (date 2026-01-04)) announcement_remains_applicable)","result_type":"bool","scope":"(and is_licensed_corporation otherwise_within_margin_requirements)"},"local_id":"reading_1","questions":["Do the underlying Code or implementing instruments narrow any listed product category or actor classification?","How does any later notice apply to existing transactions, new transactions and accrued margin obligations?"],"statement":"[TRUE_IS_SATISFIED] For a licensed corporation and an otherwise applicable margin obligation within Part III of Schedule 10, true means the assessed transaction satisfies the proposed conditions for the announced SFC exemption: it is a non-centrally cleared single-stock, equity basket or equity index option, the assessment date is on or after 4 January 2026, and the announcement remains applicable on that date. False means at least one of those conditions fails; it does not establish that margin is owed under every other rule. Outside the stated scope this control supplies no applicability decision, and unknown facts remain unknown.","subject":"Applicability of the announced SFC equity-option margin exemption"}]},"run_id":"run.fb80a0de37cc42b091ce356d6e9e87d3"}